---
---

<section class="border-y-2 border-ink bg-ink py-28 text-white sm:py-36 cv-auto" id="skills">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="mb-16 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.65fr] lg:items-end">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">02 — Complete stack</p><h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">A practical toolkit for complete product delivery.</h2></div>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/55">From browser UI and API design to databases, caching, deployment, monitoring, and developer tooling.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-12">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="h-px flex-1 bg-white/15"></span><h3 class="display text-lg font-bold">Frontend</h3><span class="h-px flex-1 bg-white/15"></span></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-7">
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="HTML5" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/html5/E34F26" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">HTML5</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="CSS" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/css/663399" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">CSS</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="JavaScript" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/javascript/F7DF1E" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">JavaScript</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="TypeScript" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/typescript/3178C6" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">TypeScript</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="Svelte" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/svelte/FF3E00" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Svelte</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="Tailwind CSS" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/tailwindcss/06B6D4" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Tailwind</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><div class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-500 font-black">I</div><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Inertia</h4></article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="h-px flex-1 bg-white/15"></span><h3 class="display text-lg font-bold">Backend &amp; data</h3><span class="h-px flex-1 bg-white/15"></span></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-7">
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="Laravel" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/laravel/FF2D20" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Laravel</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="PHP" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/php/777BB4" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">PHP</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="PostgreSQL" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/postgresql/4169E1" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">PostgreSQL</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="MySQL" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/mysql/4479A1" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">MySQL</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="Redis" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/redis/FF4438" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Redis</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><i class="ti ti-api text-4xl text-accent"></i><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">REST API</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><i class="ti ti-database text-4xl text-accent"></i><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Data Modeling</h4></article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="h-px flex-1 bg-white/15"></span><h3 class="display text-lg font-bold">DevOps &amp; tools</h3><span class="h-px flex-1 bg-white/15"></span></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-7">
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="Nginx" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/nginx/009639" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Nginx</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="Docker" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/docker/2496ED" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Docker</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="Git" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/git/F05032" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Git</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="GitHub" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/github/ffffff" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">GitHub</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="Vite" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/vite/646CFF" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Vite</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="Bun" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/bun/FBF0DF" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Bun</h4></article>
          <article class="skill-card rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-5"><img alt="Composer" class="h-9 w-9" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/composer/885630" width="36"/><h4 class="mt-5 font-bold">Composer</h4></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell py-28 sm:py-36 cv-auto">
  <div class="mb-16 flex items-end justify-between">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">03 — Services</p><h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl font-bold sm:text-6xl">From idea to production.</h2></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
    <article class="service-card group rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink p-7 transition hover:bg-accent hover:text-white sm:p-9">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="display text-sm font-bold">01</span><i class="ti ti-building-factory-2 text-4xl"></i></div>
      <h3 class="display mt-16 text-3xl font-bold">ERP Systems</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-ink/65 transition group-hover:text-white/75">Unified HR, finance, logistics, procurement, inventory, and sales modules built around your actual operations.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card group rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink p-7 transition hover:bg-accent hover:text-white sm:p-9">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="display text-sm font-bold">02</span><i class="ti ti-adjustments-code text-4xl"></i></div>
      <h3 class="display mt-16 text-3xl font-bold">Custom Systems</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-ink/65 transition group-hover:text-white/75">Purpose-built web applications that remove repetitive work, connect teams, and scale with the business.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card group rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink p-7 transition hover:bg-accent hover:text-white sm:p-9">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="display text-sm font-bold">03</span><i class="ti ti-world-www text-4xl"></i></div>
      <h3 class="display mt-16 text-3xl font-bold">Company Websites</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-ink/65 transition group-hover:text-white/75">Responsive corporate sites that communicate credibility, improve discoverability, and convert visitors.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card group rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink p-7 transition hover:bg-accent hover:text-white sm:p-9">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="display text-sm font-bold">04</span><i class="ti ti-plug-connected text-4xl"></i></div>
      <h3 class="display mt-16 text-3xl font-bold">API &amp; Modernization</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-ink/65 transition group-hover:text-white/75">REST APIs, third-party integrations, legacy-system improvements, performance tuning, and maintainability upgrades.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y-2 border-ink bg-accent py-28 sm:py-36 cv-auto">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.7fr] lg:items-end">
      <div><p class="eyebrow !text-ink/60">04 — Process</p><h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl font-bold sm:text-6xl">A clear path from ambiguity to a reliable product.</h2></div>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Services describe what I deliver. This process shows how I reduce risk, keep communication clear, and move the work forward.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative mt-16 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="absolute left-0 right-0 top-10 hidden h-0.5 bg-ink/25 lg:block"></div>
      <article class="process-card relative rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper p-7 shadow-[7px_7px_0_#151310]">
        <span class="display relative z-10 grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-accent text-3xl font-bold">01</span>
        <p class="mt-9 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-ink/45">Understand first</p><h3 class="display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Discover</h3><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Clarify business goals, user needs, constraints, existing workflows, and measurable outcomes.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="process-card relative rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper p-7 shadow-[7px_7px_0_#151310]">
        <span class="display relative z-10 grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-accent text-3xl font-bold">02</span>
        <p class="mt-9 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-ink/45">Design the system</p><h3 class="display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Architect</h3><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Define priorities, data flow, modules, technical decisions, milestones, and delivery boundaries.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="process-card relative rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper p-7 shadow-[7px_7px_0_#151310]">
        <span class="display relative z-10 grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-accent text-3xl font-bold">03</span>
        <p class="mt-9 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-ink/45">Iterate visibly</p><h3 class="display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Build &amp; Validate</h3><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Develop in focused increments, test critical flows, review progress, and incorporate practical feedback.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="process-card relative rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper p-7 shadow-[7px_7px_0_#151310]">
        <span class="display relative z-10 grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-accent text-3xl font-bold">04</span>
        <p class="mt-9 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-ink/45">Operate with confidence</p><h3 class="display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Launch &amp; Improve</h3><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Deploy safely, monitor usage and performance, document the system, and continue improving it.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
